{"actions":[{"action":"limbs:browser","definition":{"description":"브라우저(웹) 조작 — DOM ref 기반 (op 분기). Playwright/Chrome MCP. 화면 좌표 조작은 limbs:screen, 파일은 self.","group":"browser","runs_on":"pc_only","target_description":"op로 동작 선택. 흐름 — navigate(이동)→snapshot(요소 ref 획득)→click/type. Playwright는 이름·역할을 유지하는 유일 후보만 선택하며 대상이 없거나 중복이면 새 snapshot이 필요하다. 복합 동작은 mode 2차 선택 — click(single|double|right), navigate(goto|back|forward), content(text|html), tab(list|new|switch|close), logs(console|network), cookies(save|load), iframe(list|switch|reset), chrome(connect|disconnect|status). 주요 파라미터 — ref(요소), text(입력), url(이동), expression(JS), query(자연어검색), path(저장). Playwright는 작업·주체별 세션이며 결과에 session_owner·tab_id를 반환한다. dialog:accept|dismiss는 현재 조작의 확인창 정책(기본 취소, 미지정 취소는 실패), dialog_text는 prompt 응답이다. navigate의 wait:stable(기본)|load(추가 대기 없음)|idle, session_started로 기동 여부를 알린다. iframe은 name/id/index/url로 찾고 index:0이 첫 iframe이다.","callable_contract":{"version":1,"params":{"checked":"Unknown","criteria":"Unknown","dialog":"Unknown","dialog_text":"Unknown","direction":"Unknown","driver":"Unknown","element":"Unknown","expression":"Unknown","full_page":"Unknown","headless":"Unknown","height":"Unknown","id":"Unknown","index":"Unknown","key":"Unknown","label":"Unknown","mode":"Unknown","name":"Unknown","op":"Unknown","path":"Unknown","project_id":"Unknown","query":"Unknown","ref":"Unknown","scope":"Unknown","selector":"Unknown","source_ref":"Unknown","submit":"Unknown","target":"Unknown","target_ref":"Unknown","text":"Unknown","timeout":"Unknown","url":"Unknown","value":"Unknown","values":"Unknown","wait":"Unknown","wait_for":"Unknown","width":"Unknown"},"open_params":false,"required":[],"result":"Record","effects":["unknown"],"compatibility":"legacy-envelope/1","adapter":{"protocol":"legacy-envelope","value_path":""},"aliases":{"from_ref":"source_ref","to_ref":"target_ref"},"enums":{"op":["snapshot","navigate","click","type","press_key","hover","drag","select","check","upload_file","scroll","w